From b6d9e8613d15fc46b1dea6f7fec984362b7c52f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 23:22:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] safety: add standalone hondaRlxForwarder mode to bridge
 the RLX steer bus

The 2017 Acura RLX Sport Hybrid has its EPS and LKAS camera on a CAN bus
separate from the powertrain bus. This used to be driven through a second
panda that openpilot addressed as buses 4-6, but openpilot no longer
supports multiple pandas.

The new mode turns that second panda into an unattended bridge that only
forwards STEER_STATUS/CAR_SPEED from the steer bus to the powertrain bus
and STEERING_CONTROL/LKAS_HUD the other way, blocks everything else and
allows no USB TX. It is meant to be set as the boot default in the panda
firmware for that panda; openpilot never selects it.

Co-authored-by: mliza <mliza@umass.edu>
